ve or equal to zero. So, to find the domain, we solve the following inequality:\n\n$$\n2-{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}\\ge 0\\,⟹\\,{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}\\le 2.\n$$\n\nThis defines the region ${D}_{2},$ which is a circle of radius $\\sqrt{2},$ as shown below:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14042874/assets/bdf02ff330f256327d0c9f1147c388b25184610b36ea7ab77bb2c570ec3be19a.png)\n\nFinally, the domain $D$ of $F$ is given by ${D}_{1}\\cap {D}_{2},$ shown below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14042874/assets/0d3180a60e33c05e904c8fc00fdec4197510198fef3de3fa8c7b3549609205f6.png)" 13194139534900 true] [17592186318390 1000 #edb/ref 17592186318391 13194139534900 true] [17592186318390 1000 #edb/ref 17592186318392 13194139534900 true] [17592186318390 1000 #edb/ref 17592186318393 13194139534900 true] [17592186318390 1000 #edb/ref 17592186318394 13194139534900 true] [17592186318390 1000 #edb/ref 17592186318395 13194139534900 true] [17592186318390 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534900 true] [17592186318390 1041 "selection" 13194139534900 true] [17592186318390 1104 #edb/ref 17592186318394 13194139534900 true] [17592186318390 1110 #uuid "f5902226-a782-5dc9-af05-70db43f2771a" 13194139534900 true] [17592186318391 1034 "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14042874/assets/59ec29347dea9437c8217a208bde0a8b200e37fcbce9c223d0358011a0685297.png" 13194139534900 true] [17592186318391 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045452 13194139534900 true] [17592186318391 1111 #uuid "3e166f35-7a38-52de-9f28-0f70455cfe48" 13194139534900 true] [17592186318392 1034 "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14042874/assets/cb10aa8f4d930ec7422da7dedfa0650244dceb01afe7cc849ed2bb16ffd3e44d.png" 13194139534900 true] [17592186318392 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045452 13194139534900 true] [1